(A basic emergency supply kit helps a household get through the first days after a) Tj T*
(disaster, when power, water and shops may not be available.) Tj T*
T*
(Water: one gallon of water per person per day for at least three days, for drinking and) Tj T*
(sanitation.) Tj T*
T*
(Food: at least a three-day supply of non-perishable food, and a manual can opener.) Tj T*
T*
(Light and information: a flashlight, a battery-powered or hand-crank radio, and extra) Tj T*
(batteries.) Tj T*
T*
(First aid kit, a whistle to signal for help, and a dust mask to help filter contaminated) Tj T*
